# Google ベース。既定から外した設定（ForEachMacros / MainIncludeChar / IncludeCategories /
# CommentPragmas）の理由は docs/current/toolchain.md を参照。
BasedOnStyle: Google
UseTab: Never
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 120
Language: Cpp
Standard: c++20
AccessModifierOffset: -2
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: Always
AllowShortCaseLabelsOnASingleLine: true
AllowShortCompoundRequirementOnASingleLine: true
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: All
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: AllIfsAndElse
AllowShortLambdasOnASingleLine: All
BreakBeforeConceptDeclarations: Always
CommentPragmas: 'competitive-verifier:'
DerivePointerAlignment: false
ForEachMacros: ['rep', 'repn', 'repr', 'repnr']
IncludeBlocks: Merge
MainIncludeChar: AngleBracket
IncludeCategories:
  - Regex:    '"template/template\.hpp"'
    Priority: -1
IndentRequiresClause: false
PackConstructorInitializers: BinPack
PointerAlignment: Right
